{"id":"63a9c41255fee3d1","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-pa-degree-completion.md","title":"PA 度的逻辑与路径定义等价","display":"thm-pa-degree-completion — PA 度的逻辑与路径定义等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-pa-degree-completion","aliases":["20-thm-pa-degree-completion"],"display":"thm-pa-degree-completion — PA 度的逻辑与路径定义等价","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"source-verified","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3(i),(ii),(v)","source_pdf_pages":[217,218,219],"source_printed_pages":[185,186,187],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pa-degree]]","[[20-df-completion]]","[[20-thm-pa-dnc]]","[[20-thm-godel-rosser]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-pa-degree-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-pa-degree-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pa-degree-completion — PA 度的逻辑与路径定义等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-verified"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3(i),(ii),(v)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span><span>219</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span><span>186</span><span>187</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2db5acb5344c257\" href=\"?note=f2db5acb5344c257\" title=\"20-df-pa-degree\">20-df-pa-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"379df91db6a6f0af\" href=\"?note=379df91db6a6f0af\" title=\"20-df-completion\">20-df-completion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"26f419e80554b0b9\" href=\"?note=26f419e80554b0b9\" title=\"20-thm-pa-dnc\">20-thm-pa-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"96aa7c2f3c33ea30\" href=\"?note=96aa7c2f3c33ea30\" title=\"20-thm-godel-rosser\">20-thm-godel-rosser</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2db5acb5344c257\" href=\"?note=f2db5acb5344c257\" title=\"20-df-pa-degree\">20-df-pa-degree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"379df91db6a6f0af\" href=\"?note=379df91db6a6f0af\" title=\"20-df-completion\">20-df-completion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"26f419e80554b0b9\" href=\"?note=26f419e80554b0b9\" title=\"20-thm-pa-dnc\">20-thm-pa-dnc</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"96aa7c2f3c33ea30\" href=\"?note=96aa7c2f3c33ea30\" title=\"20-thm-godel-rosser\">20-thm-godel-rosser</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}degree\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\mathbf d)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\ [\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\land\n\\deg_T(\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\})=\\mathbf d].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}degree\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\mathbf d)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\ [\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\land\n\\deg_T(\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\})=\\mathbf d].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书同时证明“某个完成的度”与“计算一个完成”相等：在 Gödel–Rosser 独立句处编码任意代表元的位，其余句子用可计算不可分对的分离集合保持一致。不能只从一个低于 d 的完成就直接推出等度完成。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3(i),(ii),(v)；印刷页 185, 186, 187；PDF 第 217, 218, 219 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：编码阶段对 PA 加有限一致决定，使用有效构造的 Rosser 独立句，确保仅凭一致性，两种决定都可继续。这里不能用要求额外 ω 一致性的朴素 Gödel 正向句论证；书中的 Gödel 用语按其 Theorem 10.1.2 的 Gödel–Rosser 独立性解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"f2db5acb5344c257","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pa-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-completion","status":"resolved","id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-pa-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"26f419e80554b0b9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-pa-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-godel-rosser","status":"resolved","id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-godel-rosser]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"f2db5acb5344c257","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa-degree]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-thm-pa-dnc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-completion","status":"resolved","id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa-degree]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-thm-pa-dnc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-pa-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"26f419e80554b0b9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pa-degree]]；see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-thm-pa-dnc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-godel-rosser","status":"resolved","id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-godel-rosser]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}degree\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\mathbf d)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\ [\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\land\n\\deg_T(\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\})=\\mathbf d].","display":true}],"bytes":1760,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f2db5acb5344c257","379df91db6a6f0af","26f419e80554b0b9","96aa7c2f3c33ea30"]}